    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know people are there, but it doesn't change the reality. it's like i saw something real, something that actually mattered, and now i'm back in this hollowed out version of life. it's exhausting trying to pretend i belong in a world that feels so shallow. sometimes it just feels like i've already left, i'm just waiting for my body to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
